# Buildaze Brand

## Business
- **Name:** Buildaze
- **Tagline:** Design, Development & Digital Growth Agency
- **Audience:** Businesses needing design, development, AI, digital marketing, and Shopify growth
- **Goal:** Clear scope, practical handover, optional ongoing support; convert visitors to project enquiries
- **Live URL:** https://www.buildaze.com
- **Local:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000
- **Tone:** Practical, specific, confident; English; no invented stats/testimonials/clients
- **Logo:** `/public/Logo/` (`buildaze-logo-footer.svg`, `buildaze-logo-horizontal.svg`, `logo-1.svg`, favicon)

## Stack
Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, Framer Motion, Three.js/R3F, Lenis. No component UI library. Custom SVGs for icons (lucide-react allowed when a consistent set is needed).

