## Typography
- **Sans / UI:** Space Grotesk (`--font-space-grotesk`) — headings + body
- **Mono / labels:** Geist Mono (`--font-geist-mono`) — technical labels (`.t-label`)
- Scale tokens: `--text-display`, `--text-h2`, `--text-h3`, `--text-lead`, `--text-body`, `--text-ui`, `--text-label`

## Radius / spacing / elevation
- Control: `12px` (`--radius-control`)
- Card / panel: `14px` (`--radius-card`, `--radius-panel`)
- Buttons/CTAs: capsule (`--radius-pill` / `.rounded-pill`; `rounded-full` still OK)
- Shadows: `--shadow-cta`, `--shadow-cta-light`, `--shadow-panel`, `--shadow-nav`, `--shadow-nav-light`
- Prefer existing Tailwind spacing rhythm; keep section padding consistent with current patterns
- Extra type tokens: `text-body-sm`, `text-ui-sm`, `text-caption` (migrate one-offs over time)

## Surfaces
Use theme classes: `.surface-ink`, `.surface-blue`, `.surface-page`, `.surface-soft`, `.surface-card` (and legacy `home-surface-*` aliases). Motif: `.build-grid` / `.build-grid-blue`.

## Hard constraints
1. Keep existing color scheme. No new brand colors. Only derived tints/shades as tokens.
2. Keep logo, fonts, tone, and copy meaning unchanged unless explicitly approved.
3. Do not break functionality, routes, forms, or SEO (meta, heading hierarchy, alt text).
4. Never invent facts, stats, testimonials, or client names. Flag copy that needs input.
5. No Figma tooling or suggestions.
6. Do-not-touch without approval: contact/form delivery, voice-agent API routes, CSP/security headers, SEO redirects in `next.config.ts`, factual content in `lib/data/` (structure OK; claims need approval).
